  m_text: "It\u2019s time to find the bug! Here, you can click on every friend you\u2019ve
    made in Genetics Town and see all the sequences you\u2019ve discovered along
    the way. Click on a friend to begin. After a friend is selected, their code will
    appear on the right.\\n\n You can click the arrows to scroll through their code
    and compare it to your own code on the left. Remember, you are searching for
    a 6-letter sequence that is the same among you and every friend. Good luck!"
